-- Decor materials ("დეკორის მასალები"): what the code-built wall decor is made of — slats, slabs,
-- LED lines, mouldings, plasterboard for niches, upholstered and relief panels, brick, concrete,
-- tiles, murals, trims (lib/design/decor). Each sub-category is a kind of material a decor slot
-- takes (`DECOR_FAMILIES`); admin sets each product's unit (m², metre, piece) and price, and the
-- budget buys what the pieces measure (`decorPurchases`). A workshop store sells them. Not in the
-- calculator, not furniture, not on the studio's shelf: the studio picks them per decor piece.
